		<description><![CDATA[yah evan you missed it down in MX - on the last night they brought one of those soundsystems out to CENART, and they had the most fire banner with all their logos on it surrounding la Virgen because they are all united in some sort of soundsystem solidarity. Julio told me that they all celebrate and give thanks to la Virgen one day a year on which all the systems go out to different parts of the city and play for free. I snapped some flicks of the logo banner:
http://flickr.com/photos/bennett4senate/tags/soundsystemlogos/
ENEMIGA is my favorite.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>yah evan you missed it down in MX &#8211; on the last night they brought one of those soundsystems out to CENART, and they had the most fire banner with all their logos on it surrounding la Virgen because they are all united in some sort of soundsystem solidarity. Julio told me that they all celebrate and give thanks to la Virgen one day a year on which all the systems go out to different parts of the city and play for free. I snapped some flicks of the logo banner:<br />
<a href="http://flickr.com/photos/bennett4senate/tags/soundsystemlogos/" rel="nofollow">http://flickr.com/photos/bennett4senate/tags/soundsystemlogos/</a><br />
ENEMIGA is my favorite.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
